# OpenWiFi Common Modules

Reusable common modules used by Router Architects' OpenWiFi and Mango Cloud services.

This repository provides shared components for service discovery, RPC communication, and supporting infrastructure used across the OpenWiFi cloud stack.

## Role in Mango Cloud

This repository is part of [Mango Cloud](https://www.mangowifi.cloud/), Router Architects' open-source platform for managed Wi-Fi and connectivity operations.

Mango Cloud builds on the OpenLAN/OpenWiFi ecosystem to provide cloud-based provisioning, monitoring, device lifecycle management, subscriber workflows, analytics, topology, and operational services for managed Wi-Fi deployments.

The modules in this repository are shared by multiple Mango Cloud/OpenWiFi microservices and help provide common service-to-service functionality across the platform.

## Modules

### `fiber`

Shared asynchronous and execution utilities used by OpenWiFi cloud services.

### `servicediscovery`

Common service-discovery functionality used by distributed OpenWiFi and Mango Cloud components.

### `servicerpc`

Shared RPC functionality for communication between cloud microservices.

